      "text": "Nephi1 likens all scriptures unto his people, 1 Ne. 19:23. the Lord’s marvelous work is likened unto Israel’s being nourished by Gentiles, 1 Ne. 22:8. words of Isaiah1 concerning house of Israel may be likened unto Nephites, 2 Ne. 6:5 (11:2, 8). Israel is likened unto tame olive tree, Jacob 5:3 (6:1). they who do Christ’s sayings are likened unto man who built house upon rock, 3 Ne. 14:24.",
